docs {
  ### User Signup - Phone Number Already Registered
  Attempts to register using a phone number that is already associated with another account.
  
  #### Response (400 Bad Request)
  ```json
  {
    "statusCode": 400,
    "message": "Phone number already registered",
    "error": "Bad Request"
  }
  ```
}
